Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:16.79,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,It's the same as Nagisa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.71,0:00:22.72,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I cannot tell the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:27.47,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,But I would guess that the same suffering Nagisa-san went through will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.35,0:00:30.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just a second ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.10,0:00:33.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...she was running around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:42.23,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:00:58.25,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.09,0:01:02.22,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Who's her father?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:04.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.13,0:01:07.43,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Then you have to keep your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.03,0:01:35.62,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}The hill you once walked down...
