Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.05,0:02:29.38,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Just this one thing, this one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.05,0:02:29.38,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf19}hi{\kf19}to{\kf26}tsu {\kf20}da{\kf19}ke {\kf23}hi{\kf19}to{\kf24}tsu {\kf23}da{\kf20}ke
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.13,0:02:31.89,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}though it's a plain thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.13,0:02:31.89,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf24}a{\kf23}ri{\kf20}fu{\kf23}re{\kf19}ta {\kf18}mo{\kf21}no {\kf21}da{\kf29}ke{\kf40}do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:35.85,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}I will show it to you, this one thing covered in glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.55,0:02:35.85,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf25}mi{\kf18}se{\kf25}te {\kf22}ya{\kf19}ru {\kf18}ka{\kf21}ga{\kf23}ya{\kf23}ki {\kf20}ni {\kf17}mi{\kf26}chi{\kf14}ta {\kf27}so{\kf26}no {\kf15}hi{\kf23}to{\kf28}tsu {\kf22}da{\kf16}ke
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:41.10,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Forever and ever, I shall hold it dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:41.10,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}{\kf19}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf21}ma{\kf27}de{\kf17}mo {\kf14}i{\kf32}tsu{\kf19}ma{\kf21}de{\kf17}mo {\kf23}ma{\kf23}mo{\kf22}t{\kf16}te {\kf27}i{\kf200}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:50.36,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:52.61,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Are you cold at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.45,0:02:56.54,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,As a doll, I don't feel cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:03:00.75,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,But I'm sure her hand is cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.00,0:03:04.88,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Although I can't even tell that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.34,0:03:10.42,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,The world will soon turn completely white.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.18,0:03:12.93,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,We need to hurry a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.10,0:03:18.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 21
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.10,0:03:18.77,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}The End of the World
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.36,0:03:29.94,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,The sports day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.94,0:03:30.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:35.20,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,You're not going to run, Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.03,0:03:38.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll be with you the whole day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.99,0:03:40.54,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Akki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:46.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He might run. If two anchors skipped,\Nthey'd have trouble finding two replacements.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:52.51,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Daddy. Beat Akki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:55.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I said I'll be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:58.47,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.47,0:04:00.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So you're on my side, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.31,0:04:01.98,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:04.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm on your side, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.69,0:04:07.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:09.11,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:13.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you sleepy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.99,0:04:14.86,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.57,0:04:18.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I won't go anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.37,0:04:19.12,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:25.50,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,One week...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.50,0:04:26.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Two weeks...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.42,0:04:31.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then a month went by,\Nand Ushio's fever did not go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.13,0:04:36.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She couldn't go to kindergarten, much less leave the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:38.14,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an1\fnArial\fs36\b1\c&H6D87A0&\frz348.423\fry2\fax0.24\pos(521.17,317.5)\blur0.5}Hikarizaka Electric - Electrical Design and Setting
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.39,0:04:38.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.14,0:04:39.64,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnEdo SZ\fs54\pos(973.5,909)\c&H4B4B4B&\b1}Letter of Resignation
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:44.52,Default,Boss,0,0,0,,I don't want you leaving us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.52,0:04:47.77,Default,Boss,0,0,0,,But, looks like there are a variety of issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.77,0:05:00.41,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1.5\an1\fnArial\fs22.5\b1\c&H6D87A0&\pos(474,198)}Hikarizaka Electric - Electrical Design and Setting
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:04:57.66,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,That was a big decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:04.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san and the old man tried to stop me,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:06.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,but I want to be with Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.50,0:05:08.88,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Do you have anything saved up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.88,0:05:09.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Some.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:12.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was saving up for her education.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.92,0:05:13.51,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:16.17,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Good work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.72,0:05:19.80,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you for your guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.73,0:05:28.56,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Take it. Don't lose it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.56,0:05:31.57,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fsp15\fnEdo SZ\fs54\frz149.953\c&HA2BDD3&\bord3\3c&H58667C&\pos(1354.5,748.5)}Yoshino
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.36,0:05:33.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:37.70,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Of course not. How will I work without it from tomorrow on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.70,0:05:38.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.91,0:05:43.24,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Lend me yours instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.83,0:05:45.58,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I'll give it back to you when you return.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:49.21,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,Come back when Ushio-chan recovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.88,0:05:51.67,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I'll borrow yours until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.61,0:06:16.07,Default,Yos,0,0,0,,I'll take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.03,0:06:20.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fsp1.5\an1\fnArial\fs22.5\b1\c&H6D87A0&\pos(474,198)}Hikarizaka Electric - Electrical Design and Setting
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.41,0:06:23.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio stayed home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.78,0:06:26.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We thought about putting her in a hospital but decided not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:32.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Since we don't know the treatment for it,\Nthere was no point in staying at a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:36.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Most of all, Ushio wanted to stay home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:39.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's change into new pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:40.05,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.30,0:06:45.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You don't have to get up. I'll change you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:48.77,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.90,0:07:03.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's all right if you can't do it yourself right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:05.49,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:08.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio can't get changed alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:11.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She can't go to the bathroom alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:13.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She can only eat soft foods.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.38,0:07:19.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Won't those peaceful days ever come back again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:30.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio, do you have anything you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.48,0:07:33.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If you do, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.73,0:07:36.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll buy you anything; toys or snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.19,0:07:42.40,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I want to go on a trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.32,0:07:44.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.28,0:07:46.58,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I want to go on a trip with Daddy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.78,0:07:50.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That wasn't fun at all, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.16,0:07:52.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was in such a bad mood and yelled the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.17,0:07:55.67,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.29,0:07:57.96,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I want to go on another trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.84,0:08:02.17,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,On a train with Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Once you get better, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.47,0:08:08.56,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I want to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:14.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio... Don't ask for the impossible and trouble me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.15,0:08:24.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can't even grant the one wish my only daughter has? {ep20}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.53,0:08:27.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa... {ep20}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:29.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What should I do? {ep20}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.95,0:08:32.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If only you were here at times like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.54,0:08:38.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm... {ep20}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:43.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,My family might just be getting toyed with by this city. {ep20}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.34,0:08:48.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Given happiness, then having it snatched away. {ep20}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.06,0:08:52.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.27,0:08:56.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I will save Ushio no matter what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.15,0:08:58.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I will save Ushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:03.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Please look after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:05.57,Default,San,0,0,0,,Have a good trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.24,0:09:06.99,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.87,0:09:11.66,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.20,0:09:15.12,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.17,0:09:20.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.63,0:09:22.80,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Don't be so stubborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:25.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I don't mean it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:28.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I still have some savings,\Nso we'll be okay for a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.68,0:09:30.68,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I'll beat you up if you're lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:31.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.27,0:09:34.89,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Then fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:40.44,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,There are things a man has to protect even if it kills his pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.98,0:09:41.61,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:44.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.82,0:09:47.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If I run into something serious, I'll let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.34,0:10:05.17,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs30\b1\c&HF2C7C0&\frx14\fry18\pos(1008,243)\frz343.5\fax0.4}Hikariz{\fax0.3}aka Gener{\fax0.2}al Hosp{\fax0.1}ital
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:12.43,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Want one?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.18,0:10:15.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:17.77,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,That's wise of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.48,0:10:21.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.27,0:10:27.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,People built this hospital by sacrificing the forest that was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.99,0:10:31.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What will the next sacrifice be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.08,0:10:36.79,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,A hill on the outskirts of town is getting dug up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:39.79,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Apparently, they're building a shopping mall there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.67,0:10:43.79,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,It'll be convenient, so it's great for people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:47.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:55.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,From the moment you brought the near-death Nagisa here, Nagisa was linked to this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.93,0:10:58.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And Nagisa's daughter, Ushio, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.69,0:11:08.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Does... Is going through change a pain for the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.03,0:11:14.57,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I think it's got nothing to do with pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.49,0:11:18.95,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,"Oh, I'm changing."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.37,0:11:21.16,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,I think that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:30.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If people's deaths are a part of changing, then do we have to accept that, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.55,0:11:35.80,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,People build hospitals because they don't want to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.41,0:11:56.91,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Let this city and its people be blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.08,0:12:47.58,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you thirsty?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.04,0:12:49.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you want some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.89,0:13:02.60,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's cold, so drink slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:04.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If you go too fast, you'll get a stomachache.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:14.90,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.49,0:13:16.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:17.53,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.66,0:13:24.37,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I want to go on a trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.79,0:13:27.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sure. After you get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:30.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Where do you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:32.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you want to go to that flower patch again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:35.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah, but going north now would be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.67,0:13:36.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's go south.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:40.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,To a place where it's warm, beautiful, and there's clean air.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:42.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Or-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.10,0:13:43.35,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I want to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.85,0:13:48.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,After you get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.35,0:13:50.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I've told you so many times, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:51.40,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.07,0:13:53.32,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I want to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.32,0:13:54.53,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,To the flower patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.03,0:13:56.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.45,0:13:59.20,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,It has to be now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:03.16,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I want to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.05,0:14:16.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:19.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll let you have your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:20.84,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.80,0:14:24.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But you have to let me know when you're not feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:25.93,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.31,0:14:28.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:36.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll give you a piggy back ride. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.11,0:14:39.61,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I'll walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:40.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't push yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.37,0:14:45.58,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I want to walk with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:46.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:49.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then let's walk together as far as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:50.62,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.50,0:14:52.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:54.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's make this a fun trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.42,0:14:57.59,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.27,0:15:12.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:13.65,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.65,0:15:17.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You have to let me know the moment you're not feeling well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.94,0:15:19.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We'll go to a doctor then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.90,0:15:20.65,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.30,0:15:45.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:46.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.19,0:16:02.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's snowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:18.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you like snow, Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:19.46,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.92,0:16:22.42,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Do you like it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.26,0:16:24.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.05,0:16:29.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, I like it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:32.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Can you keep walking, Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.06,0:16:34.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you want to rest a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:35.60,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.40,0:16:38.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Let's get in a car before it starts coming down hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.27,0:16:40.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll give you a piggy back ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.07,0:16:41.78,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.79,0:17:34.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.30,0:17:50.14,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.51,0:17:52.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What is it, Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.06,0:17:54.93,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.48,0:17:57.39,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Are we on the train?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:01.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. We're on the train already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.90,0:18:05.65,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,It's dark... Is it night?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.19,0:18:08.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's right. It's midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.86,0:18:10.78,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.99,0:18:12.91,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:15.41,Default,Ush,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:16.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.58,0:18:20.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I love you, too, Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.85,0:18:34.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:36.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,USHIO!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.87,0:19:00.92,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:02.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't want this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.50,0:19:04.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.92,0:19:07.21,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Save Ushio.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:11.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.05,0:19:17.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Someone... Someone save Ushio!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.43,0:19:20.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.80,0:19:56.93,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.65,0:20:14.32,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,How many more steps will it take to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.24,0:20:18.03,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Could we be only a step away?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.87,0:20:24.33,Default,Robo,0,0,0,,Or, do we have to walk without end?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.19,0:20:55.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I hate this city. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.07,0:21:00.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's full of all the memories I want to forget about. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.08,0:21:10.96,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Go to school every day, chat with friends, and then go back to the home I don't even want to go back to. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.21,0:21:16.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Will something eventually change, doing this? {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.09,0:21:20.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Will that day come? {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:33.32,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sweet bean bread! {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.24,0:21:37.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Do you like this school? {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.57,0:21:43.20,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I really, really love it. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.49,0:21:46.96,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,But nothing can stay unchanged. {S1 ep1}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.63,0:21:55.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If I talk to her here, Nagisa and I\Nwill meet and eventually date.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.72,0:22:00.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But, maybe it was better if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.35,0:22:03.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It might've been better if we'd never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.89,0:22:09.85,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\bord0.75\3c&H000000&\blur0.5\pos(1462.5,840)}To be continued
